1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:07,108
大家好，我是 Kevin。在这段快速的 Power BI 初学者教程中，你将学习所有基础知识。
Hi, I'm Kevin, and in this quick Power BI tutorial for beginners, you'll learn all the essentials.

2
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:14,660
即使你以前从未用过 Power BI，我们也会涵盖如何导入数据、
创建你的第一个报告以及与他人共享。
We'll cover how to import data, build your first report, and share it with others, even if you've never used Power BI before.

3
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:15,920
让我们开始吧。
Let's dive in.

4
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:19,908
首先，我们需要安装 Power BI Desktop。
To get started, we'll need to install Power BI Desktop.

5
00:00:20,206 --> 00:00:24,080
它是免费的，并提供你从零开始构建报告所需的一切。
It's free and gives you everything you need to build reports from scratch.

6
00:00:24,334 --> 00:00:28,324
前往 Windows 系统预装的 Microsoft Store 应用。
Head over to the Microsoft Store app that comes pre-installed with Windows.

7
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:32,479
然后在顶部的搜索栏中输入 Power BI。
And in the search bar at the top, type in Power BI.

8
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,080
你会看到两个不同的选项。
You'll see two different options.

9
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:36,036
我们有 Power BI Desktop。
We have Power BI Desktop.

10
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:37,440
这就是你要找的那个。
This is the one that you want.

11
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:40,804
它可以让你导入数据、构建仪表板并发布报告。
It lets you import data, build dashboards, and publish reports.

12
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:47,204
另外还有 Power BI report builder，但它的功能更专业且有限。
Then there's also the Power BI report builder, but that's more specialized and limited in features.

13
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:53,252
点击 Power BI Desktop，然后选择安装，如果你还没安装的话就选择打开。
Click on Power BI Desktop and then choose install or open if you already haven't installed.

14
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:57,060
当你第一次启动 Power BI Desktop 时，你会看到这个主屏幕。
When you first launch Power BI Desktop, you'll see this home screen.

15
00:00:57,486 --> 00:01:05,220
就在最上方，你可以从空白报告开始，或者连接到 One Lake、Excel、SQL Server 等常见数据源。
Right up on top, you can start from a blank report or connect to
common data sources like One Lake, Excel, SQL Server, and also others.

16
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:09,220
如果你只是想探索一下，甚至可以导入示例数据。
You could even pull in sample data if you just want to explore.

17
00:01:09,646 --> 00:01:12,580
在“推荐”下方，你会看到一些有用的学习内容。
Under recommended, you'll see some helpful learning content.

18
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:16,804
如果你之前做过报告，它们会显示在“最近”下方。
If you've worked on reports before, they'll show up under recent.

19
00:01:17,358 --> 00:01:20,080
就在最上方，让我们点击“空白报告”来开始。
Right up on top, let's click on blank report to begin.

20
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:22,116
这会带我们进入报告视图。
This drops us into the report view.

21
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:26,308
就在屏幕中央，你会看到一些最受欢迎的数据源。
Right here in the center of the screen, you'll see some of the most popular data sources.

22
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:30,820
你也可以前往顶部的功能区来获取更多选项。
You can also head up to the top ribbon to access even more options.

23
00:01:31,374 --> 00:01:37,200
Power BI 几乎可以让你从任何地方获取数据：Excel、SQL、云服务，总之你想到的都有。
Power BI lets you pull in data from just about anywhere: Excel, SQL, Cloud Services, you name it.

24
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:43,844
在本次教程中，我有一个包含饼干销售和客户数据的 Excel 工作簿想要进行分析。
For this tutorial, I've got some cookie sales and customer data in an Excel workbook that I'd like to analyze.

25
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:47,844
就在最上方，我点击这个按钮，然后我看到了我的数据。
Right up on top, I'll click on this button and there I see my data.

26
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:52,800
如果你想跟着操作，下方描述中有一个示例 Excel 文件的链接。
If you'd like to follow along, there's a link to the sample Excel file in the description below.

27
00:01:53,166 --> 00:01:53,988
我要双击这个。
I'll double-click on this.

28
00:01:54,254 --> 00:01:57,636
一旦你打开数据，你会看到导航器窗口出现。
Once you open your data, you'll see the navigator window appear.

29
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:01,920
这显示了你 Excel 文件中所有的不同表格和工作表。
This shows you all of the different tables and sheets in your Excel file.

30
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:05,440
它还让你有机会预览其中的数据。
It also gives you the chance to preview the data inside.

31
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,360
我想把这两个工作表都导入进来。
I'd like to bring in both of these sheets.

32
00:02:07,470 --> 00:02:10,050
所以在这里，我会勾选这两个框。
So over here, I'll make sure to check both of these boxes.

33
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:16,240
在右下角，我们有两个选项：加载和转换数据。
Down in the bottom right-hand corner, we have two different options, load and also transform data.

34
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:22,404
如果你点击加载，Power BI 就会按 Excel 文件中的样子原封不动地导入数据。
If you click on load, Power BI will bring in the data exactly as it appears in the Excel file.

35
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:24,960
没有任何更改，就是直接导入。
No changes, just a straight import.

36
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:31,044
但如果你点击转换数据，就会打开一个叫 Power Query Editor 的界面。
But over here, if you click on transform data, you'll open something called the Power Query Editor.

37
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:35,360
这能让你在数据进入报告之前对其进行清洗和塑形。
This lets you clean and shape your data before it even reaches your report.

38
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:42,020
例如，你可以修正不一致的数值、删除不需要的列，甚至可以拆分或合并字段。
For example, you can fix inconsistent values, remove columns you don't need, or even split and merge fields.

39
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:45,120
在这种情况下，我们要点击转换数据。
In this case, we're going to click on transform data.

40
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:49,988
这样我们就可以看看在开始构建仪表板之前，如何快速清理数据。
That way we can look at how you could quickly clean things up before we start building our dashboard.

41
00:02:50,382 --> 00:02:53,600
记住，你也可以在稍后任何时候转换数据。
Keep in mind, you can always transform the data later as well.

42
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:54,560
我点这里。
I'll click here.

43
00:02:54,800 --> 00:03:02,240
在这段视频中，我与 Datacamp 合作，为您提供 Power BI 的入门概览。
In this video, I partnered with Datacamp to give you a high-level overview to get you started with Power BI.

44
00:03:02,702 --> 00:03:09,920
但如果你真的想学习 Power BI，我强烈推荐 Datacamp 的 Power BI 基础课程。
But if you're serious about learning Power BI, I highly recommend Datacamp's Power BI Fundamentals track.

45
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:25,732
它非常适合初学者，会带你从连接和清洗数据到构建交互式仪表板的每一步，
就像我们今天做的一样，但它使用的是真实数据集和实操练习，你可以在浏览器中进行练习。
It's perfect for beginners, walking you through everything from connecting and cleaning your data to building interactive dashboards,
just like we're doing today, but with real data sets and hands on exercises so you could practice in your browser.

46
00:03:26,702 --> 00:03:34,372
如果你想更进一步提升技能，Power BI 数据分析师课程就是为了让你具备就业能力而设计的。
And if you want to take your skills even further, the Data Analyst in Power BI track is designed to get you job ready.

47
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:39,108
它涵盖了数据建模和商业案例研究等高级主题。
It covers advanced topics like data modeling and business case studies.

48
00:03:39,502 --> 00:03:40,740
最棒的部分来了。
And here's the best part.

49
00:03:41,216 --> 00:03:44,656
Datacamp 直接与 Microsoft 合作。
Data Camp partnered directly with Microsoft.

50
00:03:44,942 --> 00:03:53,616
所以当你完成课程后，你可以获得官方 Microsoft Power BI 数据分析师认证考试 50% 的折扣。
So when you complete the track, you'll get 50% off the official Microsoft Power BI data analyst certification exam.

51
00:03:53,902 --> 00:04:00,996
所以你不仅是在学习，还在获得实践经验，并朝着行业认可的认证迈进。
So you're not just learning, you're gaining practical experience and working toward an industry recognized certification.

52
00:04:01,376 --> 00:04:05,376
你可以在下方的评论中找到这两个课程的链接。
You'll find links to both tracks pinned in the comment right down below.

53
00:04:05,536 --> 00:04:07,972
现在我们进入了 Power Query Editor。
This drops us into the Power Query Editor.

54
00:04:08,176 --> 00:04:11,428
在左侧，你可以看到查询列表。
Over on the left-hand side, you'll see a list of queries.

55
00:04:11,630 --> 00:04:14,896
每一个查询都代表我们 Excel 文件中的一张表。
Each one represents a table from our Excel file.

56
00:04:15,056 --> 00:04:17,476
在这种情况下，我们有客户和订单。
In this case, we have customers and orders.

57
00:04:17,870 --> 00:04:19,935
现在我正在查看订单表。
Right now I'm looking at the orders table.

58
00:04:20,176 --> 00:04:24,004
在顶部，你可以看到所有的不同列。
And across the top, you can see all the different columns.

59
00:04:24,256 --> 00:04:25,696
让我们稍微清理一下。
Let's clean this up a little bit.

60
00:04:25,856 --> 00:04:29,936
我不需要“加急运输”列来进行这次分析，把它删掉。
I don't need the rush shipment column for this analysis to remove it.

61
00:04:30,158 --> 00:04:33,540
只需右键点击它，在菜单里我们可以选择删除。
Simply right-click on it, and in this menu, we have the option to remove.

62
00:04:33,902 --> 00:04:35,456
我选一下，看看效果。
I'll select that and look at that.

63
00:04:35,790 --> 00:04:36,324
它全没了。
It's all gone.

64
00:04:36,558 --> 00:04:43,044
顺便提一下，我们在 Power BI 里删除列时，并不会删除原始 Excel 文件里的内容。
Just a quick note when we remove a column here in Power BI, we're not deleting it from the original Excel file.

65
00:04:43,278 --> 00:04:45,892
我们只是选择不把它导入到 Power BI 里。
We're just choosing not to bring it into Power BI.

66
00:04:46,190 --> 00:04:49,216
你的源数据完全不会受到影响。
Your source data stays completely untouched.

67
00:04:49,454 --> 00:04:52,484
接下来，最好检查一下数据类型是否正确。
Next, it's a good idea to check that the data types look correct.

68
00:04:52,782 --> 00:04:56,804
Power BI 通常能很好地自动识别，但还是核实一下比较稳妥。
Power BI usually does a great job guessing, but it makes sense to verify.

69
00:04:57,102 --> 00:04:58,016
我们拿一个例子看看。
Let's take an example.

70
00:04:58,190 --> 00:04:59,716
这里我有订单日期。
Here I have the order date.

71
00:04:59,936 --> 00:05:03,972
你可以通过查看列名旁边的这个小图标来查看数据类型。
You can see the data type by looking at this small icon next to the column names.

72
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:09,668
如果发现不对，只需点击这个图标，然后从下拉菜单中选择正确的数据类型。
If anything looks off, just click on this icon and then you can choose the correct data type from this dropdown.

73
00:05:10,030 --> 00:05:13,892
在右侧，你会看到一个叫「已应用的步骤」的面板。
Over on the right hand side, you'll see a pane called Applied Steps.

74
00:05:14,256 --> 00:05:19,268
它会记录你做的每一次更改，就像是你所有转换操作的历史记录一样。
This keeps track of every change you make, kind of like a history of all of your transformations.

75
00:05:19,758 --> 00:05:23,972
如果你需要撤销某些操作或者查看你做了什么，就看这里。
If you ever need to undo something or see what you've done, this is the place to look.

76
00:05:24,366 --> 00:05:30,576
举个例子，如果我想把那列重新带回来，我可以点击这个图标，然后我就能看到加急发货了。
As an example, if I want to bring that column back over here, I can click on this icon, and there I see rush shipments again.

77
00:05:30,766 --> 00:05:33,216
但我其实不需要它，所以我们再把它删掉一次。
But I actually don't need it, so let's remove it once more.

78
00:05:33,456 --> 00:05:36,736
现在一切看起来都没问题了，让我们应用这些更改吧。
Now that everything looks good, let's go ahead and apply these changes.

79
00:05:36,976 --> 00:05:40,576
点击左上角的「关闭并应用」。
In the top left-hand corner, let's click on close and apply.

80
00:05:40,846 --> 00:05:43,332
我差点忘了，我们还没清洗客户数据。
I almost forgot we didn't even clean the customer data.

81
00:05:43,598 --> 00:05:45,508
别担心，你不需要重新开始。
No worries, you don't have to start over.

82
00:05:45,856 --> 00:05:52,736
在主页选项卡的正中间，你可以看到「转换数据」选项，直接跳回 Power Query Editor。
On the home tab, right in the center, you see the option to jump right back into the Power Query editor with transform data.

83
00:05:52,846 --> 00:05:53,508
点这里。
Let's click here.

84
00:05:53,710 --> 00:05:57,476
在左侧，确保点击进入客户。
Over on the left hand side, let's make sure to click into customers.

85
00:05:57,870 --> 00:06:00,100
现在，你可能会注意到一个重要的问题。
Now, you might notice something important.

86
00:06:00,336 --> 00:06:03,524
我们数据的第一行没有显示为列标题。
The first row of our data isn't showing up as column headers.

87
00:06:04,014 --> 00:06:08,804
当 Power BI 没能自动检测到文件中的标题时，有时就会发生这种情况。
That happens sometimes when Power BI doesn't automatically detect the headers in your file.

88
00:06:09,198 --> 00:06:13,860
要修复这个问题，只需点击这个图标，然后我们可以选择「将第一行用作标题」。
To fix that, simply click on this icon, and here we can use the first row as headers.

89
00:06:14,478 --> 00:06:15,056
好多了。
Much better.

90
00:06:15,342 --> 00:06:17,056
现在，这里有一个常见问题。
Now, here's a common issue.

91
00:06:17,326 --> 00:06:20,484
在国家这一列中，有些数据不一致。
Under the country column, we've got some inconsistencies.

92
00:06:20,942 --> 00:06:25,380
你可以看到有些写的是 United States，有些写的是 US。
You can see that some of them say United States and others say US.

93
00:06:26,030 --> 00:06:32,452
这看起来可能不是个大问题，但如果我们尝试按国
家进行分组或筛选，它会把这些当成两个不同的值。
That might not seem like a big deal, but if we try to group or filter by country, it'll treat these as two separate values.

94
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:33,796
让我们来修正一下。
Let's fix that.

95
00:06:34,016 --> 00:06:38,564
就在上方，我们右键点击国家，这里可以看到替换值的选项。
Right up above, let's right-click on the country, and here we see the option to replace values.

96
00:06:38,862 --> 00:06:39,300
点击它。
Click on that.

97
00:06:39,616 --> 00:06:46,116
在这个窗口里，在“要查找的值”中，我输入 US，我想把它替换为 United States。
In this window, for the value to find, I'll type in US and I want to replace it with United States.

98
00:06:46,606 --> 00:06:49,284
然后点击右下角的确定。
Then down in the bottom right-hand corner, let's click on OK.

99
00:06:49,486 --> 00:06:55,492
就这样，我们现在把所有这些条目都标准化了，Power BI 会把它们视为同一个国家。
Just like that, we've now standardized all of those entries, and Power BI will treat them as the same country.

100
00:06:55,856 --> 00:06:59,588
在右侧，你现在可以在“已应用的步骤”下看到这个变化。
Over on the right hand side, you can now see the change under applied steps.

101
00:06:59,936 --> 00:07:04,100
这意味着下次我们刷新数据时，它会自动应用。
This means that it'll automatically apply the next time we refresh our data.

102
00:07:04,416 --> 00:07:11,536
现在我们完成了数据转换，点击左上角的“关闭并应用”，这将带我们回到报表视图。
Now that we're all done transforming our data, in the top left-hand corner, let's click on close and apply,
and that'll bring us back to the report view.

103
00:07:11,758 --> 00:07:15,136
现在让我们切换到左侧的数据模型视图。
Let's now switch over to the data model view over on the left-hand side.

104
00:07:15,342 --> 00:07:16,016
我点一下这里。
I'll click here.

105
00:07:16,206 --> 00:07:23,108
在这里，你可以看到我们导入的所有不同数据表，
以及 Power BI 检测到的表与表之间的任何关系。
Here you'll see all the different data tables that we imported, along with any relationships that Power BI detected between them.

106
00:07:23,406 --> 00:07:34,532
在这种情况下，Power BI 通过客户 ID 字段自动识别了客
户表和订单表之间的关系，这是这些表之间的公共字段。
In this case, Power BI automatically identified the relationship between our customers and orders tables through the customer ID
field, which is a common field between these tables.

107
00:07:35,054 --> 00:07:36,708
这个关系是合理的。
The relationship makes sense.

108
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:39,972
每个客户可以有多个订单。
Each customer can have multiple orders.

109
00:07:40,336 --> 00:07:43,908
如果 Power BI 没有检测到那个链接，也没关系。
If Power BI hadn't detected that link, no problem.

110
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:51,136
你只需把客户 ID 从一个表拖到另一个表，就可以手动创建关系。
You can simply drag the customer ID from one table to the other to create a relationship manually.

111
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:53,856
然后你就可以简单地指定关系。
And then you can simply specify the relationship.

112
00:07:54,286 --> 00:07:55,360
我点取消。
I'll click on cancel.

113
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:59,460
现在模型都设置好了，我们准备好开始构建报表了。
Now that our models all set up, we're ready to start building our report.

114
00:07:59,758 --> 00:08:02,628
在左侧，让我们点回报表视图。
Over on the left hand side, let's click back into the report view.

115
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,484
这就是奇迹发生的地方。
This is where the magic happens.

116
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:07,280
你会看到中间有一个空白画布。
You'll see a blank canvas in the center.

117
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:10,788
而在右侧，我们有两个关键面板。
And over on the right hand side, we have two key panes.

118
00:08:11,278 --> 00:08:14,372
首先是数据，也就是所有的不同字段。
First up, we have data or all of the different fields.

119
00:08:14,670 --> 00:08:16,000
这就是你的数据所在的地方。
This is where your data lives.

120
00:08:16,270 --> 00:08:21,060
如果我展开这些不同的类别，你可能就能认出所有这些不同的列标题了。
If I expand these different categories, you'll probably recognize all of these different column headers.

121
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:24,080
就在旁边，是可视化选项。
Right next to that, we have visualizations.

122
00:08:24,526 --> 00:08:27,428
这里是选择如何展示数据的地方。
This is where you choose how to display that data.

123
00:08:27,662 --> 00:08:29,760
让我们从构建第一个可视化图表开始。
Let's start by building our first visual.

124
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:32,960
我想看看随着时间的推移，我们一共发出了多少块饼干。
I'd like to see how many cookies we've shipped over time.

125
00:08:33,102 --> 00:08:35,428
我觉得折线图非常适合这个需求。
And I think a line chart will be perfect for this.

126
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:40,548
在可视化窗格中，这里就是折线图图标。
In the visualizations pane, here we have the line chart icon.

127
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:44,356
点击它，它就会在画布上插入一个占位符。
Let's press on that and that inserts a placeholder on the canvas.

128
00:08:44,910 --> 00:08:46,980
现在我们只需要给它添加数据。
Now we just need to add data to it.

129
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:50,148
在右侧，我们可以看到所有的数据。
Over on the right hand side, we have all of our data.

130
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:55,844
首先，按住订单日期，把它拖到 X 轴上。
Let's start by pressing and holding on the order date and drag that over to the x-axis.

131
00:08:56,622 --> 00:09:02,244
接下来，向上找到发出的饼干，按住它，把它拖到 Y 轴上。
Next, let's go up to cookie shipped, press and hold, and let's drag that down to the y-axis.

132
00:09:02,862 --> 00:09:06,692
就这样，我们得到了一个显示饼干发货量随时间变化的图表。
And just like that, we've got a visual showing our cookie shipments over time.

133
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:09,732
你可以通过拖动角落来调整这个图表的大小。
You can resize this chart by dragging the corners.

134
00:09:09,934 --> 00:09:12,132
在这里我可以把它放大，也可以把它缩小。
Here I can make it larger or we can make it smaller.

135
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:16,164
我还可以把它移动到画布上的任何位置。
I could also reposition it on the canvas wherever I would like.

136
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:19,440
你还可以向下或向上钻取层级。
You can also drill up or down in the hierarchy.

137
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:22,080
目前，它显示的是按年份划分的数据。
Currently, it's showing me the data by year.

138
00:09:22,286 --> 00:09:26,880
在这里，我们可以一直钻取到按天划分的饼干发货量。
Over here, we could drill all the way down to cookie shipments by day.

139
00:09:27,118 --> 00:09:30,628
接下来，我们用卡片图来显示总收入。
Next, let's show total revenue using a card visual.

140
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:37,956
点击画布上的空白区域，然后在右侧的数据窗格中，勾选收入旁边的框。
Click the blank space on the canvas, then over on the right hand side in the data pane, check the box next to revenue.

141
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:42,532
Power BI 会自动插入一个图表，但我们需要更改它。
Power BI will insert a chart automatically, but we need to change it.

142
00:09:42,990 --> 00:09:46,884
选中该可视化图表后，前往可视化窗格。
With the visual selected, go to the visualizations pane.

143
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:49,668
就在这里，点击卡片图标。
And right here, let's click on the card icon.

144
00:09:50,094 --> 00:09:53,604
现在我们得到了一个显示总收入的醒目数字。
Now we've got a nice bold number showing the total revenue.

145
00:09:53,870 --> 00:09:57,860
我不知道你们怎么想，但我妈总是说饼干生意里有钱赚。
I don't know about you, but Mama always said there is money in the cookie business.

146
00:09:58,126 --> 00:10:02,340
现在让我们再加一个可视化图表，一个显示客户名称的表格。
Let's now add one more visual, a table that shows our customer names.

147
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,880
在画布上选择一个空白位置。
Select an empty spot on the canvas.

148
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:09,732
然后在右侧的“数据”下，勾选客户名称旁边的框。
Then over on the right hand side under Data, let's check the box next to Customer Name.

149
00:10:10,126 --> 00:10:12,400
Power BI 会自动添加一个表格。
Power BI automatically adds a table.

150
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:15,236
最酷的一点是，这些可视化图表是可交互的。
What's really cool is these visuals are interactive.

151
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:18,000
我们可以点击这个表格中的任何一个客户。
We could click on any customer in this table.

152
00:10:18,222 --> 00:10:20,080
让我们选第一个，Abbott。
Let's select this first one, Abbott.

153
00:10:20,430 --> 00:10:26,308
你会注意到折线图和收入卡片会自动更新，只显示该客户的数据。
You'll notice that the line chart and the revenue card automatically update to show the data just for that customer.

154
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:30,692
如果你想选择多个客户，甚至可以按住 Ctrl 键。
You could even press the control key if you'd like to select multiple customers.

155
00:10:30,926 --> 00:10:36,580
要清除筛选，只需点击空白区域，我们就能回到整体汇总数据。
To clear the filter, simply click in a blank area, and there we're back to the overall aggregate data.

156
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:38,560
这就是关联数据的威力。
That's the power of connected data.

157
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,640
所有数据都能无缝联动。
It all flows together seamlessly.

158
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:47,280
当然，你可以继续完善仪表板，添加更多可视化图表、应用筛选，甚至自定义格式。
Of course, you can continue refining your dashboard, add more visuals, apply filters, or even customize the formatting.

159
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:52,640
但这已经给了你构建全交互式 Power BI 仪表板的核心基础。
But this gives you the essentials to start building a fully interactive Power BI dashboard.

160
00:10:52,814 --> 00:10:57,360
当你准备好分享报告时，点击顶部功能区的发布图标。
When you're ready to share your report on the top ribbon, click on the publish icon.

161
00:10:57,646 --> 00:10:59,364
就在下方，让我们保存更改。
Right down below, let's save the changes.

162
00:10:59,694 --> 00:11:02,948
在这里给文件起个名字，然后点击下方的保存。
Here, let's give the file a name, and then down below, click on save again.

163
00:11:03,278 --> 00:11:04,800
接下来，你可以选择你的工作区。
Next, you can choose your workspace.

164
00:11:05,006 --> 00:11:07,268
我选择我的工作区，然后点击选择。
I'll select my workspace and then click on select.

165
00:11:07,566 --> 00:11:09,764
现在它正在上传到 Power BI service。
Now it's uploading to the Power BI service.

166
00:11:10,030 --> 00:11:12,160
瞧，它已经成功发布了。
And look at that, it's been successfully published.

167
00:11:12,494 --> 00:11:13,120
让我们点击这个。
Let's click on this.

168
00:11:13,454 --> 00:11:16,880
这会带我们进入 Power BI service，我们可以在这里做一些不同的操作。
This drops us into the Power BI service, and we can do a few different things here.

169
00:11:17,102 --> 00:11:24,580
在左上角，我们可以点击文件菜单，你可以把这个
报告直接嵌入到 SharePoint 网站甚至普通网站上。
In the top left-hand corner, we can click on the file menu and you can embed
this report directly on a SharePoint website or even just on a website.

170
00:11:25,006 --> 00:11:34,240
在最上方，你还可以把它导出到，比如 Microsoft Excel、PowerPoint、PDF，
甚至可以直接在 Microsoft Teams 或通过电子邮件分享。
Right up on top, you could also export this into, say, Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, PDF,
and you can even share this directly in Microsoft Teams or via an email.

171
00:11:34,414 --> 00:11:36,320
这真的让协作变得非常简单。
It really makes collaboration easy.

172
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:37,520
就这样。
And that's it.

173
00:11:37,774 --> 00:11:43,876
你刚刚完成了数据的导入和清洗，构建了第一个交互式仪表板，并把它分享给了全世界。
You just imported and cleaned data, built your first interactive dashboard, and shared it with the world.

174
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:52,260
如果你想通过实操练习将 Power BI 技能提升到更高水平，一定要看看下方 Datacam 的课程。
If you want to take your Power BI skills to the next level with hands-on practice, be sure to check out Datacam's tracks below.

175
00:11:52,494 --> 00:11:56,292
此外，还能获得 Microsoft 官方认证的 50% 折扣。
Plus, a 50% discount on Microsoft's official certification.

176
00:11:56,560 --> 00:12:03,716
如果你想在未来的报告中看到巨大的销售增长，记得去 Kevin Cookie Company 订购饼干。
And if you want to see a big sales spike in these reports in the
future, just remember to order a cookie from the Kevin Cookie Company.

